{"seq":2,"slug":"conflict-resolution-strategies","title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies","wordCount":1859,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"冲突解决策略\">冲突解决策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>冲突是离线优先架构的固有特征——多设备并发修改同一数据后必须合并。核心概念包括：冲突的形式化定义（向量时钟并发关系）、五种策略梯度（LWW → 字段级合并 → OT → 自定义合并函数 → 三路合并）、检测时机选择、用户参与的异步解决模式，以及从简单到复杂的渐进式升级路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突的本质-并发写入的不可避免性\">冲突的本质：并发写入的不可避免性</h2><p>当两台设备在离线期间修改了同一份数据的同一部分，并在重新连接后尝试同步时，冲突就产生了。在 CAP 定理的框架下，离线优先架构选择了可用性（A）和分区容错（P），因此冲突不是可以避免的异常，而是架构的固有特征。</p>\n<p>形式化定义：给定操作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">op_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">op_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，若它们的向量时钟满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VC(op_a) \\| VC(op_b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（并发关系），且两者修改了同一数据的重叠部分，则构成冲突。</p>\n<p>冲突解决策略的选择标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据语义保真度</strong>：解决后的结果是否保留了所有用户的意图</li>\n<li><strong>自动化程度</strong>：能否无需用户干预自动解决</li>\n<li><strong>实现复杂度</strong>：从简单 LWW 到完整 CRDT 的复杂度梯度</li>\n<li><strong>性能开销</strong>：元数据存储和合并计算的资源消耗</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"策略一-最后写入者胜出-last-writer-wins\">策略一：最后写入者胜出（Last-Writer-Wins）</h2><p>LWW 是最简单的冲突解决策略：比较两个冲突写入的时间戳，保留更新的那个，丢弃更旧的。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>resolve</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{resolve}(op_a, op_b) = \\begin{cases} op_a &amp; \\text{if } ts(op_a) &gt; ts(op_b) \\\\ op_b &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">resolve</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现极简，无额外元数据</td>\n<td>静默丢失较早的写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性收敛（所有节点看到相同时间戳做相同决策）</td>\n<td>依赖时钟同步（设备时钟偏差 → 不公平判定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几乎零性能开销</td>\n<td>不保留合并意图（两个不冲突的字段修改也会整行覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>LWW 在移动端的陷阱</strong>：用户手动调整设备时间（时区切换、手动拨时钟）会让 LWW 做出错误判定。缓解方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用 HLC（Hybrid Logical Clock）替代纯物理时钟——HLC 保证单调递增，不受时钟回拨影响</li>\n<li>由服务端在收到变更时打上服务端时间戳——但这要求设备联网时才能获得最终排序</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>CloudKit 和 SwiftData 的默认策略就是字段级 LWW</strong>——iOS 19 中 SwiftData over CloudKit 以字段为粒度，只有被修改的字段参与 LWW 比较，未修改字段保持不变。这比行级 LWW 大幅减少了信息丢失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略二-字段级合并-field-level-merge\">策略二：字段级合并（Field-Level Merge）</h2><p>将行级 LWW 细化到字段级别，每个字段独立追踪版本：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;设备 A(离线修改)&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;title: &#39;买菜&#39; → &#39;买水果&#39;&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;priority: 保持不变&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;设备 B(离线修改)&quot;&#10;        B1[&quot;title: 保持不变&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;priority: &#39;low&#39; → &#39;high&#39;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;合并结果&quot;&#10;        R1[&quot;title: &#39;买水果&#39;(来自 A)&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;priority: &#39;high&#39;(来自 B)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; R1&#10;    B2 --&gt; R2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"设备 A(离线修改)\"\n        A1[\"title: '买菜' → '买水果'\"]\n        A2[\"priority: 保持不变\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"设备 B(离线修改)\"\n        B1[\"title: 保持不变\"]\n        B2[\"priority: 'low' → 'high'\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"合并结果\"\n        R1[\"title: '买水果'(来自 A)\"]\n        R2[\"priority: 'high'(来自 B)\"]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; R1\n    B2 --&gt; R2</pre><p>字段级合并需要为每个字段维护独立的版本元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;task-123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;买水果&quot;, &quot;hlc&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T10:30:00.000Z-0001-deviceA&quot; },&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;high&quot;, &quot;hlc&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T10:35:00.000Z-0001-deviceB&quot; },&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;hlc&quot;: &quot;2026-07-18T09:00:00.000Z-0001-deviceA&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"task-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"买水果\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hlc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T10:30:00.000Z-0001-deviceA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hlc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T10:35:00.000Z-0001-deviceB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hlc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-18T09:00:00.000Z-0001-deviceA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>元数据开销：每个字段额外存储一个 HLC 时间戳（约 30-40 bytes），对于字段数较少的业务实体（10-20 字段）可接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略三-操作变换-operational-transformation\">策略三：操作变换（Operational Transformation）</h2><p>OT 通过变换并发操作的参数来消除冲突。当两个操作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">op_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">op_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并发时，通过变换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 生成调整后的操作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>o</mi><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>使得</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(op_a, op_b) = op_a&#x27; \\quad \\text{使得} \\quad \\text{apply}(op_b, \\text{apply}(op_a&#x27;, S)) = \\text{apply}(op_a, \\text{apply}(op_b&#x27;, S))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">使得</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>OT 在移动端的局限性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要中心化的排序服务器——离线时无法确定操作的全局顺序</li>\n<li>变换函数的正确性证明极其困难——Google Docs 的 OT 实现经过数十年打磨</li>\n<li>不适合长时间离线场景——操作积压后变换链过长</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此 OT 主要用于<strong>实时协作编辑</strong>（文本编辑器）且假设持续在线，不适合移动端离线同步的主架构。移动端更推荐 CRDT，详见 <a href=\"crdt-mobile-applications\">CRDT 在移动端的应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略四-自定义合并函数\">策略四：自定义合并函数</h2><p>针对特定业务语义设计定制的合并逻辑。这是最灵活也最危险的方案——合并函数的正确性完全依赖开发者的理解。</p>\n<p>常见模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>合并策略</th>\n<th>数学基础</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计数器</td>\n<td>各增量累加</td>\n<td>PN-Counter CRDT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合（标签、成员）</td>\n<td>并集</td>\n<td>OR-Set / Add-Wins Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序列表</td>\n<td>RGA/Fugue 算法</td>\n<td>操作式 CRDT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔开关</td>\n<td>OR（任一设为 true 则结果为 true）</td>\n<td>Flag CRDT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额/数值</td>\n<td>禁止并发修改，强制冲突上报</td>\n<td>保守策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PowerSync 采用的正是自定义合并函数模式——写入通过开发者定义的 API 端点上传，服务端在该端点内实现业务特定的合并逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略五-三路合并-three-way-merge\">策略五：三路合并（Three-Way Merge）</h2><p>基于共同祖先（Common Ancestor）的差异合并，类似 git merge：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BASE[共同祖先版本 Base] --&gt; A[设备 A 修改版]&#10;    BASE --&gt; B[设备 B 修改版]&#10;    A --&gt; MERGE[三路合并]&#10;    B --&gt; MERGE&#10;    MERGE --&gt; RESULT[合并结果]\">flowchart TD\n    BASE[共同祖先版本 Base] --&gt; A[设备 A 修改版]\n    BASE --&gt; B[设备 B 修改版]\n    A --&gt; MERGE[三路合并]\n    B --&gt; MERGE\n    MERGE --&gt; RESULT[合并结果]</pre><p>算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>计算 <code>diff(Base, A)</code> = 设备 A 的变更集</li>\n<li>计算 <code>diff(Base, B)</code> = 设备 B 的变更集</li>\n<li>若两个变更集不重叠 → 自动合并（应用两组变更）</li>\n<li>若重叠 → 触发冲突解决策略（可升级为用户选择）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三路合并的前提是能获取共同祖先版本。这要求同步系统维护版本历史——在移动端意味着额外的存储开销。适用于版本化文档类应用（如 Git、Notion 的块编辑）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突检测时机\">冲突检测时机</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测时机</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端推送时</td>\n<td>服务端比较版本号</td>\n<td>立即反馈</td>\n<td>需等到联网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端拉取时</td>\n<td>客户端比较本地 vs 远端</td>\n<td>可离线检测</td>\n<td>检测滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并时</td>\n<td>CRDT 自动合并</td>\n<td>零延迟</td>\n<td>结果可能不符预期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性审计</td>\n<td>后台任务对比所有副本</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>资源开销大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用户参与的冲突解决\">用户参与的冲突解决</h2><p>当自动策略无法做出满意决策时，需要将冲突上升给用户：</p>\n<p>设计原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>展示差异</strong>而非原始数据——高亮冲突字段，并排显示两个版本</li>\n<li><strong>提供默认推荐</strong>——基于时间戳或启发式选择「推荐版本」，让用户一键确认</li>\n<li><strong>允许逐字段选择</strong>——用户可以从两个版本中挑选各字段的最优值</li>\n<li><strong>异步解决</strong>——冲突不阻塞其他操作，用户可以稍后处理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>冲突的存储与上报需要专门的数据结构。同步引擎应维护 <code>conflict_log</code> 表记录所有冲突及其解决路径，便于 <a href=\"../operations/sync-monitoring-debugging\">同步监控与调试</a> 中的问题追溯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略选择决策树\">策略选择决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[需要选择冲突解决策略] --&gt; Q1{数据是否允许丢失?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|可接受旧版本丢失| LWW[LWW - 最简实现]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|不可丢失| Q2{数据结构类型?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|简单 KV/字段| FIELD[字段级合并]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|集合/列表/计数器| CRDT[CRDT]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|复杂文档| Q3{是否需要实时协作?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| CRDT_ADV[高级 CRDT - Yjs/Automerge]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| THREE_WAY[三路合并 + 人工兜底]\">flowchart TD\n    START[需要选择冲突解决策略] --&gt; Q1{数据是否允许丢失?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|可接受旧版本丢失| LWW[LWW - 最简实现]\n    Q1 --&gt;|不可丢失| Q2{数据结构类型?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|简单 KV/字段| FIELD[字段级合并]\n    Q2 --&gt;|集合/列表/计数器| CRDT[CRDT]\n    Q2 --&gt;|复杂文档| Q3{是否需要实时协作?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| CRDT_ADV[高级 CRDT - Yjs/Automerge]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| THREE_WAY[三路合并 + 人工兜底]</pre><p>实践建议：从 LWW 开始，在用户反馈数据丢失后逐步升级到字段级合并或 CRDT。过早引入复杂冲突策略会增加大量开发和调试成本，而许多应用的实际并发冲突率远低于预期（单用户多设备的冲突远少于多用户协作场景）。<a href=\"sync-protocol-design\">同步协议设计</a> 中的粒度选择直接影响这里的策略选型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>冲突解决策略的选择本质上是「数据保真度 vs 实现复杂度」的权衡。LWW 最简但会丢失并发编辑，CRDT 数学保证收敛但元数据开销大，自定义合并函数最灵活但正确性完全依赖开发者。实践中应从最简策略出发，基于真实用户反馈的数据丢失案例逐步升级。决策树和检测时机的选择为工程实现提供了清晰的路径指引。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冲突解决策略","id":"冲突解决策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突的本质：并发写入的不可避免性","id":"冲突的本质-并发写入的不可避免性"},{"level":2,"text":"策略一：最后写入者胜出（Last-Writer-Wins）","id":"策略一-最后写入者胜出-last-writer-wins"},{"level":2,"text":"策略二：字段级合并（Field-Level Merge）","id":"策略二-字段级合并-field-level-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"策略三：操作变换（Operational Transformation）","id":"策略三-操作变换-operational-transformation"},{"level":2,"text":"策略四：自定义合并函数","id":"策略四-自定义合并函数"},{"level":2,"text":"策略五：三路合并（Three-Way Merge）","id":"策略五-三路合并-three-way-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突检测时机","id":"冲突检测时机"},{"level":2,"text":"用户参与的冲突解决","id":"用户参与的冲突解决"},{"level":2,"text":"策略选择决策树","id":"策略选择决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/sync-protocol-design"},"next":{"title":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/crdt-mobile-applications"}}